# Leave this unset during development.
# Unset -> the app calls "/api/predict" and Vite proxies it to
# http://127.0.0.1:5000/predict, so no CORS is involved.
#
# Set it only when you deploy the frontend somewhere the Flask API is on a
# different origin. In that case you must also enable CORS in app.py.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api-host.example.com
